('edinburgh-redheughs-avenue','1 Redheughs Avenue data centre, South Gyle',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Edinburgh','1 Redheughs Avenue','EH12 9RH','City of Edinburgh Council','scotland','Scotland','United Kingdom','scotland','City of Edinburgh Council; Scottish Government DPEA (appeal)','PPA-230-2794 (appeal)','refused','Refused by City of Edinburgh Council; appeal lodged with the DPEA','2026-02-04','type_unconfirmed','data_centre','unknown',NULL,'MW','unclear','medium',true,now(),'2026-08-12','published',17,'Refused by councillors against officer recommendation and now under appeal. A figure of 213 MW has been reported at proposal stage but its definition is unstated, so it is excluded from any capacity total.','[]'::jsonb,'[{"title":"Case PPA-230-2794","url":"https://www.dpea.scotland.gov.uk/CaseDetails.aspx?ID=128582","publisher":"Scottish Government, Planning and Environmental Appeals Division"}]'::jsonb,true,'Council application reference not retrieved; appeal outcome pending.')
